      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Title Amount (RM) Parliament of Malaysia 145,353,000 Keeper of Rulers’ Seal Office 2,500,000 National Audit Department 158,105,900 Election Commission 200,000,000 Public Services Commission 39,864,900 Prime Minister’s Department 4,472,882,000 Public Service Department 1,434,173,700 Attorney General’s Chambers 178,000,000 Malaysian Anti-Corruption Commission 299,111,600 Treasury 4,547,258,900 Treasury General Services 14,891,440,200 Contribution to Statutory Funds 1,590,338,200 Ministry of Foreign Affairs 703,128,300 Ministry of National Unity 320,337,400 Ministry of Plantation Industries and 476,665,900 Commodities Ministry of Agriculture and Food 3,277,853,300 Industries Ministry of Rural Development 3,533,304,400 Ministry of Energy and Natural 1,064,364,000 Resources Ministry of International Trade and 582,338,300 Industry Ministry of Domestic Trade and 1,084,554,500 Consumer Affairs Ministry of Entrepreneur Development 192,450,000 and Cooperatives Ministry of Works 1,260,407,200 Purpose Title B. 28 Ministry of Transport B. 30 Ministry of Science, Technology and Innovation B. 31 Ministry of Tourism, Arts and Culture B. 32 Ministry of Federal Territories B. 33 Ministry of Environment and Water B. 40 Education Service Commission B. 42 Ministry of Health B. 43 Ministry of Housing and Local Government B. 45 Ministry of Youth and Sports B. 46 Ministry of Human Resources B. 47 Ministry of Communications and Multimedia B. 48 Ministry of Women, Family and Community Development B. 60 Ministry of Defence B. 62 Ministry of Home Affairs B. 63 Ministry of Education B. 64 Ministry of Higher Education TOTAL"
